{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41607","headline":"林居喜崔三博远至 · 伍乔","name":"林居喜崔三博远至","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"几日区区在远程，晚烟林径喜相迎。\n姿容虽有尘中色，巾屦犹多岳上清。\n野石静排爲坐榻，溪茶深煮当飞觥。\n留连话与方经宿，又欲携书别我行。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"伍乔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41607.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41607","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}